OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fturning more frequent and heavier
OL,7,Facross western areas of Tayside and
OL,8,FCentral region during the evening,
OL,9,Fotherwise outbreaks isolated with few
OL,10,Freaching the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMost east of A9 dry with
OL,13,Fbest of the brighter spells appearing
OL,14,Fthrough the morning. Scattered showers
OL,15,Fto west of the A9, building in the far
OL,16,Fwest for the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
