OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FIsolated
OL,6,Fshowers Sunday morning, then periods
OL,7,Fof rain for afternoon. Most dry on
OL,8,FMonday with showers generally confined
OL,9,Fto the far west. Tuesday turning wet
OL,10,Fand windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
